# two occurrences: the first is the match's own window and a second follows it, so a gate returning a later occurrence starts past the match (S464)
pattern (?i)cat
features all
encoding byte
ms 0 "CAT CAT" 0 3
ms 1 "CAT CAT" 4 7
ms 2 "CAT CAT" 4 7
ms 3 "CAT CAT" 4 7
ms 4 "CAT CAT" 4 7
